  "details": "Forwarding your login data to an avatar creator to upload their comission to your account is forbidden by the VRChat TOS. Plenty of ppl to it anyways because there is no other option.\n\nVRChat Team, could you please add a token-system? The idea is simple:\n\nThe Avatar Creator logs into their own account in unity as usual.\n\nThe Buyer then generates a token from the VRC-Website and forward this token to the creator.\n\nThe token is valid for ... idk anything between 15min - 1week. Whatever you think fits.\n\nThe SDK has a new option to upload the avatar to another account by using a token. \n\nThis way you can upload an avatar to another account without sharing your login data",
